.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]A wealthy, womanizing pop idol, Daisuke rudely
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]dismissed an elderly fan who asked for an
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]autograph — and she cursed him on the spot. Now
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]any woman's amorous touch turns him into a
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]handsome black rabbit until he escapes her sight,
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]clothes and all left behind. Chastened but hardly
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]reformed, he's determined to track the old woman
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]down and get the curse lifted.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Lecherous, self-absorbed, and far too
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]famous for his own good, Daisuke's
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]biggest problems are entirely of his own
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]making — when he isn't chasing girls, he's
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]complaining about his food.
.CP
.SH
\&Daisuke: Attacks
.PP
\&Crouching Rabbit, Hidden Bunny: Daisuke's fondness for martial arts movies has led to spending megabucks on tutors.
.PP
\&This Axe Goes to 11!: In desperation, Daisuke can sacrifice his guitar to save his hide…
.SH
\&Daisuke: Black Bunny!
.PP
\&While transformed, Daisuke loses nearly all his Abilities but gains Quick +2 and Awkward Size -2. He reverts to human form once he's out of the sight of the woman who triggered the change — his clothes, unfortunately, do not come with him.
.SH
\&Daisuke: Fluff
.PP
\&Concept: Cursed Singing Lech, Birthday: August 7, Age: 24, Gender: Male, Height: 5'9", Weight: 146 lbs., Hair: Black, Eyes: Red, Association: Soh-nii Records, Hobbies: Chasing Girls, Favorite Food: Chicken and Waffles (…and Glazed Carrots), Allies: He, Himself, and Him, Enemies: A Mean Ol' Bag.
